    "statement": "The augmentation's rho targets were chosen by profiling the 210 benchmark line_noise instances: their rho medians (0.94 / 5.23 / 25.19 / 45.66 across n buckets, max 96.3) drove batch 2's rho grid of (2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64, 100). No benchmark instance and no benchmark label was ever read into training, so this is not leakage; but the coverage was deliberately aimed at the evaluation set's locus and must be disclosed as test-locus-targeted coverage.",
